Here's your token so you can push gems. It expires in 24 hours:

<%= @token %>

You probably want to pass the token as an ENV variable to these commands:

  GEM_HOST_API_KEY=<%= @token -%> gem push --host <%= Peak.host -%>/<%= @namespace.name -%>
  GEM_HOST_API_KEY=<%= @token -%> RUBYGEMS_HOST=<%= Peak.host -%>/<%= @namespace.name -%> rake release

NOTE: Remember to fill in the namespace name.
